msgid "The Pin data changes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:138
msgid ""
"The UI widget receives a notification and redraws itself (updating the "
"text and color)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:139
msgid ""
"The next `is_modified` property access in `PinmuxManager` will return "
"`True`, until the save action is triggered."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:141
msgid "The Saving Process"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:143
msgid ""
"When you press Save (`s`), the app performs strict validation before "
"writing to disk."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:145
msgid "**Step 1: Validation**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:147
msgid ""
"**Check Conflicts:** Are two pins assigned to the same non-repeatable "
"function? If yes → Error."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:148
msgid ""
"**Check Requirements:** Are all functions required by the configuration "
"assigned to valid pins? If no → Error."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:150
msgid "**Step 2: Writing**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:152
msgid ""
"If there are no errors, the pin mapping is saved to the "
"`<identifier>.pinmux` file using the simple key-value format."
msgstr ""

